      "layering_notes": "Riverside County's Housing and Workforce Solutions (HWS) department runs the Urban County HUD programs, PLHA, HHAP, Homekey+ sponsorships and project loans, while the Housing Authority of the County of Riverside (HACR, same Board sitting as Commissioners) supplies project-based vouchers, housing successor funds and land; rivcohws.org and harivco.org block automated access, so records were built from Board of Supervisors files on riversidecountyca.iqm2.com and media.rivcocob.org, RUHS Behavioral Health, the Assessor and the County Housing Element. HHAP in Riverside County is an operating and services source: the County routes it through HACR as operating subsidies on PBV projects rather than funding capital, so developers should ask HACR for an HHAP operating subsidy commitment alongside PBVs. The CoC also distributes HUD CoC Program funds (2025 ESG awards of $738,124 accepted October 6, 2026) and the County runs Encampment Resolution Funding through RUHS Behavioral Health. Source is the September 15, 2026 Board file accepting the County HHAP-6 allocation (standard agreement 25-HHAP-10051).",
