      "typical_award_size": "HACR administers 10,187 Housing Choice Vouchers. The FY 2026-27 Streamlined Annual PHA Plan (adopted March 24, 2026) programs about 684 PBVs across 24 new developments, including Desert Marigold, Cathedral City (96 of 97 units), Villa Verde, Coachella (87 of 152), Summit View, Beaumont (47 of 48), Palm Villas Phases I and II, Palm Desert (45 each of 88), Camino Terrace, Jurupa Valley (42 of 80), Bell Ranch, Wildomar (32 of 129), Murrieta Phase II and Oakview II (32 each of 81), Viscar Terrace, Murrieta (31 of 151), JFM Villas I and II, Indio (25 each), Cambern, Lake Elsinore (19 of 76), Mary McDonald Riley Street, Lake Elsinore (15 of 16), Sparrow at Mulberry Gardens, Riverside (14 of 59), 5th Street, Corona (11 of 11), Sunrise at Bogart (11 of 23), Thomas Village, Palm Desert (8 of 40) and Murrieta Phase I (8 of 119). PBVs are awarded through competitive RFPs (most recent reported round July 27 to August 22, 2025) and AHAP and HAP contract forms are approved by the Board (2026 approvals for 5th Street, Linwood Rose, Villa Verde I and II, 6th Street Seniors, Palm Desert Housing, Jefferson Family and Palm Villas).",
